==English==

===Etymology===
From [[w:French language|French]] ''[[tabac]] [[râpé]]'' "[[grate]]d [[tobacco]]", [[past participle]] of ''[[râper]]'' "to grate"; from [[w:Old French|Old French]] ''rasper'' "to [[scrape]]"; of [[Germanic]] origin.

